Revision history for Perl extension Template::Plex.
v0.1.4 2026-04-28
  [Features]
    - Added delegate field
    - Added inline_only output option
    - Added ids method/function. Maps a key local to template to global id.
      Auto creates id if not existing.  Helpful in for html tags requiring ids
    - Added UUID to deps
    - Add redriect output filter (File::Path::Redirect)
    - Add symlink output filter
    - Add jpack output filter

  [fixes]
    - clean up sys paths when no relative segment provided
    - explicitly use an empty string on undefined values
      

v0.1.3
  [Features]
  - Add supports for inhertiting of templates via use of a package name
  - Update to use Tempalte::Plex v0.9.4
  - Inline rendering option
    
v0.1.2
  [Fix]
    - Normalize external paths relative to source dir

v0.1.1
    [Fix]
      - Address missing files due to  incorrect filtering in MANIFEST.SKIP

0.1.0  2024-11-10
	- Inital version
